# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; NEVER commit a private key.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   source .env
#
# Used by scripts/Deploy.s.sol and scripts/PayRequest.s.sol.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your key. Yours to place here; nothing in this repo will ask for it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRIVATE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The circuit's verifying-key hash.
#
# NOT OPTIONAL AND NOT CEREMONY. TenureRegistry.expectedVkHash starts at zero and every callback
# reverts until it is set; a WRONG value is worse than an unset one, because it would accept proofs
# from a different circuit entirely.
#
# This value belongs to brevis-sdk v0.3.33. The v0.3.12 hash (0x028f783f...) is dead - the upgrade
# changed the constraint system, so it would reject every real proof.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CIRCUIT_VK_HASH=0x0230047e074d6b8c19ab6714303a3c84412e6dc7a6d540835925f1e08e6f94b8

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Destination chain. Pick ONE block and uncomment it.
#
# Sepolia is the recommended first attempt: it costs testnet ETH, so a failure costs nothing.
# Its risk is that Sepolia appears only on Brevis' LEGACY deployments page, so fulfilment workers
# may no longer service it - the contract is live and the gateway accepts queries for it, but
# neither of those proves a callback will land.
#
# Arbitrum One is the one pair in Brevis' current docs (mainnet data -> Arbitrum). It costs real
# ETH. Both BrevisRequest addresses were verified live with `cast call ... brevisProof()`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Sepolia (11155111) — testnet, try first
BREVIS_REQUEST=0xa082F86d9d1660C29cf3f962A31d7D20E367154F
POOL_MANAGER=0xE03A1074c86CFeDd5C142C4F04F1a1536e203543
RPC_URL=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com

# --- Arbitrum One (42161) — real ETH
# BREVIS_REQUEST=0x91540fe35a245ba83459f6410c86f1aec309b290
# POOL_MANAGER=0x360E68faCcca8cA495c1B759Fd9EEe466db9FB32
# RPC_URL=https://arb1.arbitrum.io/rpc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Filled in AFTER the two earlier steps, for scripts/PayRequest.s.sol.
# REGISTRY comes from the Deploy run; PROOF_ID and NONCE are the two halves of the query key
# printed by `npm run gateway`. A nonce is minted per submission - a key from an earlier run is
# not interchangeable with a later one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
REGISTRY=
PROOF_ID=
NONCE=
FEE_WEI=0
CALLBACK_GAS=400000
